From 7e17c03398c5cc7677102a61437b77b167ca8304 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lukin <mylukin@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Mar 2026 07:12:18 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 28/98] fix: restore 5 features lost during upstream merge

1. reply-dispatcher: restore emitMessageSent hooks for text replies
   (streaming close + non-streaming chunk delivery)
2. streaming-card: restore updateCardFull() fallback for Feishu 10-min
   auto-close survival
3. bot-content: fix normalizeMentions to use sorted-keys longest-match
   one-pass regex (prevents @_user_1 corrupting @_user_10)
4. session-memory/transcript: restore delivery-mirror skip filter in
   getRecentSessionContent
5. streaming-card: restore sequence snapshot pattern (only commit on
   success)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
